# Copy this file to `data_dir.local` in the same folder, then put ONE line in
# it: the absolute path to the read-only recordings directory on THIS machine.
#
# `data_dir.local` is gitignored, so each machine may point somewhere
# different (a drive letter that differs, a local cache, a share). Blank lines
# and lines starting with # are ignored; the first real line wins.
#
# The NEURALGEOM_DATA_DIR environment variable, if set, overrides this file.
#
# Forward slashes are fine on Windows. Example:
Z:/Users/Shouvik/Modelling/SampleData
